ormally entered the galactic freight business, establishing its base of operations at Omnithos. Jaemin, the corporation's newly appointed director, confirmed the launch of its first train, the Omnivore No.1, which departed Omnithos this starcycle.","body2":"\"We are here to compete,\" Jaemin said in a brief public statement. The arrival of Omnivore Logistics draws immediate comparisons to Pulsar Bound, which also launched recently. Whether there is room in the galaxy for both corporations remains an open question.","pageNum":1,"imgType":"ceo_jaemin","_pln":{"id":736,"starId":205,"orbitRadius":2223.0001912344715,"orbitAngle":50.686864053082694,"orbitSpeed":0.00014997375043783982,"x":-121748.44744415293,"y":-47787.90332612738,"size":"M","radius":96,"type":{"id":"resort","base":"#0e58b8","hi":"#38aaf0","rim":[65,175,255],"_b":{"id":"resort","lms":[{"cx":0.828679947698925,"cy":-0.1110428789034679,"rx":0.4990937072489412,"ry":0.2841605660863199,"rot":2.4172124580004084,"isLarge":true,"pts":[{"x":-0.30664650718199565,"y":0.15448565565263528},{"x":-0.5818725339581386,"y":0.09368120771202589},{"x":-0.5527107610998672,"y":-0.05506126223787612},{"x":-0.30720214535406115,"y":-0.12540059587433072},{"x":-0.26336624968808436,"y":-0.27449128224404895},{"x":-0.028547842272074915,"y":-0.317292824174908},{"x":0.1403481054481882,"y":-0.19026203171340486},{"x":0.43080724882858157,"y":-0.21703668144405672},{"x":0.5607547485990084,"y":-0.09028125407752599},{"x":0.3321146127800695,"y":0.03308538764637864},{"x":0.3980972640969723,"y":0.16250418458557542},{"x":0.2800257910223949,"y":0.29185455057424875},{"x":0.025771102802953912,"y":0.2864309642921673},{"x":-0.16929436948934676,"y":0.22950285359266168}],"sand":"rgba(234,203,137,0.93)","veg":"rgba(73,125,57,0.93)","deep":"rgba(25,83,16,0.93)"},{"cx":-0.13155573199669787,"cy":0.7441219836221836,"rx":0.059947266051947265,"ry":0.045555529356507765,"rot":0.11084282818692373,"isLarge":false,"pts":[{"x":0.06532324558998436,"y":0.005524980955226743