29043,"y":-35161.10920628756,"size":"L","radius":2048,"colorName":"teal","name":"Rigel Major 922","planetIds":[940,941,942],"proxyPlanetId":50265,"color":{"hi":"#defffa","core":"#40ffdd","glow":"#00bb88","edge":"#005544"}}},"minor1":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Completes Livestock Delivery to Aeronion This Starcycle","line1":"Omnivore Logistics's latest quarterly performance figures came in below expectations, widening the gap with sector leader Pulsar Bound.","line2":"An anonymous source at Omnivore Logistics attributed the shortfall to operational inefficiencies and increased route costs.","pageNum":10},"minor2":{"headline":"Omnivore Logistics Shareholders Concerned Over Slower Growth vs. Pulsar Bound","line1":"Omnivore Logistics has withdrawn a route application near Rigel-B 953, citing strategic review — a move observers say signals a retreat from the sector.","line2":"The withdrawal leaves Pulsar Bound as the sole operator in the corridor for the foreseeable future.","pageNum":10}},{"sd":841,"layout":2,"issueNum":12,"paperName":"The Nebula Times","paperSlogan":"Your universe, delivered daily","major":{"headline":"Fog Patterns Shift — New Sectors May Soon Be Accessible","body1":"Explorers at the edge of known space have reported a significant new discovery near Rigel-B 953, revealing a cluster of previously unmapped worlds ripe for future trade routes.","body2":"The findings have excited cartographers and freight companies alike. Pulsar Bound is reportedly already evaluating the potential routes, with a full survey expected within two stardates.","pageNum":5,"imgType":"star","_pln":{"id":50134,"starId":134,"isStarProxy":true,"x":-31192.822851576493,"y":-11073.035888928105,"radius":1024,"orbitRadius":0,"orbitAngle":0,"orbitSpeed":0,"size":"XL","name":"Sgr Ultima 783","starOrbitR":1434,"starOrbitROuter":2253,"hasStation":false,"isAlienRelic":false,"isStarter":false,"moons":[],"ring":null,"clouds":[],"cloudAngle":0,"hasGold":false,"goldRevealed":false,"goldPatch